contiennent tous

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.670
des informations sensibles.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.210
L'objectif de la sécurité,

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:29.750
shangle,

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:30.930
l'objectif de la sécurité,

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:31.150
shangle.

